# Only for tests and demos: run another program in place of the Claude Code CLI (for example the
# fake one in packages/agent-runtimes/test-fixtures/fake-claude.mjs, run by Node).
# Empty: the real Claude Code CLI is found as usual.
# NEURONS_DESKTOP_CLAUDE_COMMAND is the program; NEURONS_DESKTOP_CLAUDE_ARGS is a JSON list of
# the arguments that come before the CLI's own.
NEURONS_DESKTOP_CLAUDE_COMMAND=
NEURONS_DESKTOP_CLAUDE_ARGS=

# The server's NEURONS_* variables (data folder, Claude Code binary, guards...) also apply; see
# apps/server/README.md. The app fixes the profile (local), the address (127.0.0.1) and the port.
